{"summary":"A puzzle game where you collect water of the same color and complete a tube!","description":"Play our watercolor sorting puzzle to train your brain and challenge yourself!\n\n[How to play]\n– Tap a tube to pour water into another tube.\n– You can only pour water on top of the same color.\n– You can only pour water if there is enough space.\n– You can move water of any color into an empty tube.\n– Beat the level by collecting water of the same color in each tube.\n– You can find \"?\" by moving the water on the top.\n– If you get stuck, you can retry the level.\n\n[Features]\n– You can play this game with one finger.\n– There is no time limit; play anytime, anywhere.\n– Easy to play.\n– You can customize tubes, caps, and backgrounds.\n– Use items for easy wins!\n– Compete with other players and get high rankings to earn extra rewards.\n– Daily quests offer move, time, hidden modes, and gold rewards.\n– Infinite competition mode allows you to compete with users for records.\n\nHelp : cs@mobirix.com\n\nHomepage :\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4864673505117639552","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E7ad09ihhUQ?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0hktkjyyooFmQyHwnz9p16MhN3ty3k8IF5dmt5DXlHf-Tw64iCgBXRLTyCHTx40Tl6SDwl_ULvRvvOIxe4Kn","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KR_NhUMOhW7i-Kq0r41c61LoViSOfrA7RIkxJUHvuXzuMfR9VuEyVNVdcolkvYEg1PUSgxt5mRqF94mn1iGkAg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1JapNcLYqBqj5xR31MvKORyxqD1bxm4K9uwleRT4ibykdKrNNfC-eM9lVaaBoqlIJr8AdyvMZN-1wGiwONUcHg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HynDby7eY2VHQ_yArg8fX8shL_2LYCR3kaLCcFeQoPupnJk2_CKjDs5cFSQAihYZnPENDwdR-CwOVL_fT1AsRw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z3ubYUKYR_VH1d01GFlNHqZ24cPW99jaO76oA9NDhqj6koZvEWey6ef0OQyzzOTA-0I-6Qm9yH1WdcE7sWdv","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/13OuEi1IPNCzvaWJd-Vm9viXJHxlbJvoIUrjLYJfpQL